.TH AVR\-REPO\-PUBLIC\-MIRROR 1 "" "avr 0.1.6" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-repo-public-mirror \- Request and browse mirrors of public GitHub repositories.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr repo public-mirror
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Request and browse mirrors of public GitHub repositories.
.PP
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
cancel
Cancel one pending public-mirror request.
.TP
check
Check whether a public GitHub repository mirror is available.
.TP
request
Request a mirror of a public GitHub repository.
.TP
requests
List your organization's public-mirror requests.
.TP
view
View one public-mirror request.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-repo (1),
.BR avr-repo-list (1),
.BR avr-repo-public-mirror-cancel (1),
.BR avr-repo-public-mirror-check (1),
.BR avr-repo-public-mirror-request (1),
.BR avr-repo-public-mirror-requests (1),
.BR avr-repo-public-mirror-view (1)
